WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:0
Go Fish: collect four cards of a rank as a book.
Play three hands; the most books wins.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:16.999 line:0
Click a 6 in hand, click South, press Ask.
South has none, so North fishes a card.

00:00:16.999 --> 00:00:24.999 line:0
Fast-forward: a player holding the rank gives all
of them, and the asker may ask again.

00:00:24.999 --> 00:00:35.001 line:0
North asks South for kings; South gives 1.
North may ask again.

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:41.001 line:0
Fast-forward: no match means an automatic fish;
drawing the asked rank lets you ask again.

00:00:41.001 --> 00:00:51.000 line:0
East gives three queens, completing North’s four:
they form a book and leave the hand.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:01:00.000 line:0
Fast-forward through hand one;
it ends once all 13 books are made.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:14.000 line:0
Fast-forward: hands two and three are dealt fresh;
books add up across the hands.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:23.000 line:0
East wins with 13 books in total;
South, North and West have 12, 11 and 3.
